-- Transport crews from TrinityCore TDB 7.3.5.
-- Boats, zeppelins, turtles and the Icecrown gunships load their crew from creature rows on the transport's own map (gameobject_template Data6),
-- with positions relative to the ship. Our DB had none, so every transport between zones sailed empty.
-- 291 crew on 17 transports, guids 735200001-735200291. Phase 169 (TDB default) -> 0. Deck patrol paths are left out (crew stand still).
-- Also removes 124 static copies of the same crew that the dump had in world coordinates (sniff snapshots of passing ships:
-- floating in the air over Tirisfal, Stranglethorn, the Barrens and Icecrown, or standing on water at the docks). TDB has these NPCs only on the transports.

